  "label": "The woman is mapped as the person who owns the truck with transmission issues.",
  "description": "The top text 'it wasn't my fault' is mapped onto the woman in the image, implying she is the one making the excuse. The bottom text 'my truck has tranny issue's' further confirms that the woman is the owner of the vehicle and is attributing the problem to the truck itself, not her own actions. The visual of the woman smiling while looking at the man (who appears to be a mechanic) supports the idea that she is the one making the excuse, and the text overlays explicitly assign this role to her.",
